    {
      "title": "Hotfix 6/4/25",
      "anchor": "Hotfix_6/4/25",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Hotfix recap list with everything that's been fixed in SMITE 2 since the OB11 Update on Monday! These fixes are live on PC and Console."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Fixed Ranked progress not updating correctly"
            },
            {
              "text": "Fixed Assault Meditation Relic not showing FX"
            },
            {
              "text": "Merlin ability 1: Adjusted Outer Ring FX behavior and visibility when hitting targets to ensure clarity during combat."
            },
            {
              "text": "Scylla ability 1: Resolved an issue where her decal appeared offset to the right in Practice Mode only."
            },
            {
              "text": "Sobek Land Shark: Fixed a bug where the skin appeared blown out on Low settings."
            },
            {
              "text": "Scylla (Shadow and Radiant Skins): Fixed a bug where her dogs were missing from the model."
            },
            {
              "text": "Arcane Ape Hun Batz (Out-of-Game): Adjusted weapon offset to prevent clipping with hat."
            },
            {
              "text": "Roll the Dice Jump Stamp: No longer invisible on Low settings during matches."
            },
            {
              "text": "Shattered Shot Jump Stamp: FX now properly displays on Low settings."
            },
            {
              "text": "Baron Samedi: Fixed an Issue where Baron's Brew cooldown could be reset by switching consumable slots"
            },
            {
              "text": "Fixed an issuer were player names were appearing as \"...\" in several places"
            },
            {
              "text": "Fixed an issue where the Beaky Bot Announcer Pack wasn't playing correctly"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subsections": []
    },
